  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam Private Sector Development Partnership (VPSDP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment focuses on creating concrete opportunities for inclusive, sustainable private investment in Vietnam through targeted advisory support and interventions. The Partnership supports resilient, gender and climate-smart private sector development to support Vietnam&#x2019;s long term socio-economic development ambitions. It has four areas of work (i) Enabling Environment for Private Sector; (ii) Accelerating inclusive and climate- smart private investment in key growth sector; (iii) Creating a green, sustainable and inclusive financial sector and (iv) Enhancing gender equality, inclusive development and environmental and social standards.   It is implemented by the International Finance Corporation.</narrative>
  </description>
